  "term_and_condition": "<h2 class=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 1.6em; line-height: 1.4em; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\">Affiliate Agreement</h2><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">This agreement describes the terms and conditions for participation in the Deep Waters Project affiliate program. In this agreement, the term \"Affiliate\" refers to you (the applicant). In this agreement, “Deep Waters Project” refers to Heart of a Man Inc., with whom you are entering this agreement. By applying to the Deep Waters Project affiliate program you are confirming that you have read the agreement and agree to the terms and conditions.</p><h4 style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\"><b>Affiliate Program</b></h4><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">There is one method of receiving commissions and this comes through making sales through the affiliate's personal link.</p><h4 style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\"><b>Commissions</b></h4><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">For a sale to generate a commission to an Affiliate, the customer must complete the order form and remit full payment for the product. Commissions will only be paid on sales that are made when the customer clicks through qualified, correctly structured Affiliate links. Properly coded links are the sole responsibility of the affiliate. Commissions can be viewed on the Affiliate Dashboard.</p><h4 style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\"><b>Payment</b></h4><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">An Affiliate can request a payment when their balance reaches a minimum balance of $25 USD. Payments can be requested every 30 days. Payment processing can take up to 30 days from the request date. Payments will generally be paid out via PayPal.</p><h4 style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\"><b>Refunds</b></h4><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">In the event a customer requests a refund for a transaction for which the Affiliate has earned commissions, any commissions earned on the refund amount will be deducted from the Affiliate’s balance.</p><h4 style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\"><b>Usage and Obligations</b></h4><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">Affiliates are permitted to use the Deep Waters Project brand and marketing resources<span style=\"background-color: initial;\">. Logos and other assets cannot be modified. The Affiliate does not gain any trademark, copyright or any other rights to these materials.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">The Affiliate will never imply that they are acting on behalf of Deep Waters Project and will never advertise Deep Waters Project products directly. The Affiliate will never bid for advertisements that compete with Deep Waters Project.</p><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">The Affiliate will never represent themselves, Deep Waters Project or their relationship with Deep Waters Project in a false or misleading way.</p><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">The Affiliate will not engage in the distribution of an unsolicited bulk email (spam) mentioning or referencing Deep Waters Project.</p><p><br style=\"color: rgb(59, 64, 76); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"></p><h4 style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\"><b>Term and Termination</b></h4><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">Either party has the right to terminate the agreement immediately without prior notice.</p><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">If the Affiliate terminates the agreement, no further commissions from Deep Waters Project will be paid for any past or future customer transactions.</p><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">If Deep Waters Project chooses to terminate the agreement, any balance greater than $25 USD will be paid to the affiliate within 60 days of termination. Balances that are smaller than $25 will be forfeited.</p><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">If the Affiliate is on a recurring program, Deep Waters Project will not be obligated for any future payments after termination.</p><h4 style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\"><b>Governing Law</b></h4><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">This Agreement shall be governed, construed, and enforced in accordance with the laws of the State of Indiana, without regard to its conflict of laws rules.</p><h4 style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\"><b>Arbitration</b></h4><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">All claims and disputes arising under or relating to this Agreement are to be settled by binding arbitration in the State of Indiana. An award of arbitration may be confirmed in a court of competent jurisdiction.</p><h4 style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(59, 64, 76);\"><b>Modification</b></h4><p style=\"font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7em; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(43, 62, 81);\">We may modify any of the terms and conditions within this Agreement at any time and at our sole discretion. These modifications may include, but not limited to changes in the scope of available commissions, commission schedules, payment procedures and Affiliate Program rules.</p>",
